    <!-- Willkommensseite: YuneBridge ist ein Fork, die Community-Hinweise beziehen sich auf Gadgetbridge -->
    <string name="first_start_open_source_text">YuneBridge is an open source app based on Gadgetbridge, which is developed by the community, for the community.\n\nYuneBridge contains no ads and no tracking. It keeps your data locally on your Android device, so it is 100% privacy friendly.\n\nAll credit for device support goes to the Gadgetbridge developers. Visit the Gadgetbridge website for documentation and to contribute.</string>
